# Blytz Capstone Rules

## Layout

- Keep `manage.py` at the repository root. Project package is `config/`.
- Domain code lives in `apps/<name>` with `name = "apps.<name>"` in each `apps.py`.
- Register apps in `INSTALLED_APPS` as `"apps.<name>"`.
- Put remove.bg, AI, and email clients in `services/` wrappers; apps call wrappers, not third-party SDKs directly.
- Templates go in root `templates/`; static assets in root `static/`; uploads in `media/` (gitignored).

## Settings

- Use `django-environ`. Prefer env vars over hard-coded secrets.
- Default DB is SQLite via `DATABASE_URL` fallback; MySQL comes later through `DATABASE_URL`.
- Respect `MESSENGER_PAGE_USERNAME` and `PAYMENT_WINDOW_MINUTES` (default 10).
- Dev email stays on the console backend unless explicitly changed.

## Tailwind

- Theme tokens live in `docs/PROJECT_BRIEF.md` and `src/styles/main.css` (`@theme`).
- Default UI is black/white (`ink`, `canvas`, `border`, …). Gold (`gold`, `gold-soft`) is optional border or soft background accent only — never primary action fill.
- Headings: `font-display` (Playfair Display). Body: `font-sans` (GitHub-style system stack).
- Prefer design-system partials in `templates/components/`. Bases: `base_public.html`, `base_customer.html`, `base_staff.html`.
- Keep focus rings visible (`focus-visible:outline-ink`). Mobile-first layouts.
- Use `python manage.py tailwind runserver` (or `tailwind build` / `watch`) via django-tailwind-cli — no Node toolchain.
- Component gallery: `/dev/components/` (DEBUG only).

## Migrations / User model

- `AUTH_USER_MODEL` is `accounts.User` (email login, `role`, `phone`).
- Role guards: `apps.accounts.decorators` and `apps.accounts.mixins`.
- Post-login redirects via `AccountAdapter`: customers → `/app/`, staff/admin → `/staff/`.
- Keep allauth email verification mandatory; console email backend in development.

## Style

- Match existing Django patterns in this repo; keep changes scoped to the task.
- Prefer clear names over clever abstractions.
